                                "example_id": "bfbb3951-cb4f-46c3-8ea2-06e4d64bebf1",
                                "sense_id": "68e8a8a1-038d-3837-968e-f955ae1c197f",
                                "text": "Pour le prouver, il débourse de sa poche 850 thakas (24 euros). Ces prêts taille XXS aideront à financer les microprojets de quarante-deux femmes parmi les plus pauvres de Jobra. Cela leur suffit, par exemple, pour acquérir une poule et générer un revenu quotidien de la vente des œufs.",
                                "translation": "To prove it, he pays 850 taka (24 euros) out of his own pocket. These very small loans will help to finance the microprojects of forty-two women who are among the poorest in Jobra. It is enough, for example, for them to buy a hen and generate a daily income by selling eggs.",
                                "english": "To prove it, he pays 850 taka (24 euros) out of his own pocket. These very small loans will help to finance the microprojects of forty-two women who are among the poorest in Jobra. It is enough, for example, for them to buy a hen and generate a daily income by selling eggs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c0c2652-a91e-4a07-979b-01b4c207d091",
                                "sense_id": "68e8a8a1-038d-3837-968e-f955ae1c197f",
                                "text": "Quelques doubles aussi, avec ou sans salle de bains, certaines taille XXS.",
                                "translation": "Some doubles too, with or without en suite, some very small.",
